      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds... kind of peaceful, actually. but i feel like if i do that, there's no coming back. i'm just stuck in this loop where every \"solution\" i think of just makes me feel more paralyzed. it's like i've built a cage that i can't even open from the inside. is there even a point to trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken like this?",
